{
  "name": "Core-AI-Brain",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Core AI Brain (Sub-Workflow)\nCalled by every platform handler via **Execute Workflow**.\n\n**Input** (passthrough): `chatbotId, sessionId, platform, userMessage, mediaType, mediaUrl, customerInfo`\n**Output**: `replyText, galleryImages[], isOrderCreated`\n\n### Setup\n1. Set env var `GOOGLE_GEMINI_API_KEY` (used by Embed / Vision / Transcribe HTTP nodes).\n2. Copy this workflow's ID into each platform handler's *Execute Core AI Brain* node.\n3. RAG is scoped per-tenant: `chatbotId` column OR `metadata->>'chatbotId'` (mirrors lib/ai/rag.ts getContext).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "core-note",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1360,
        40
      ]
    },
